  "ruleText": "Ban 102.02 \"Commissioner\" means the bank commissioner of the state of New Hampshire banking department appointed under the provisions of RSA 383:1.\n\nSource. #1596, eff 6-30-80; ss by #2062, eff 6-25-82; ss by #2685, eff 4-20-84; EXPIRED 4-20-90\n\nNew. #6146, eff 12-22-95; ss by #10258, eff 1-24-13 (from Ban 101.01); ss by #14096, eff 10-3-24",
